<h3><u>Baba Aao Na</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Baba Aao Na</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Eik Bibi(s.a.) Yaad Mein Baba Ki<br>
Moti Ashkon Kay Piroti Hai<br>
Jaagti Hai Naa Soti Hai<br>
Bas Ro Rokar Yeh Kehti Hai<br>
Meray Baba Haey Baba Aao Na</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p>
<p>Din Kat Tay Hain Ro Rokar Ratein Katein Fariyadon Mein</p>
<p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p>
<p>Bain Karon Kab Tak Baba Main(s.a.) Ashkon Ki Barsaaton Mein</p>
<p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p>
<ol><li>Tum Jab Say Gaey Saathi Meri Beemari Hai Tanhai Hai</li><p>Uthta Hi Nahin Sar Bistar Say Kuch Aisi Naqahat Chai Hai</p><p>Ashkon Kay Deep Jalati Hoon Tanhai Ki In Raaton Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Dukh Beemari Ka Kaafi Tha Kion Dard-e-Judai Dekay Gaey</li><p>Eik Choti Behan(s.a.) Humjoli Thi Tum(a.s.) Saath Usay Bhi Lekay Gaey</p><p>Woh(s.a.) Hoti To Dil Behlati Main Us Say Baton Baton Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Maen To Sahar Hoti Hain Baiti Kay Liey Har Toofan Mein</li><p>Main Kaisay Guzarongi Lamhay Tanhai Kay Aisay Zindan Mein</p><p>Khat Likhnay Ko Bas Rehta Hai Qirtaas-o-Qalam Ab Hathon Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Cheh Maah Hue Aai Na Khabar Pardes Ko Janay Walon Ki</li><p>Khojaey Na Rotay Rotay Kahin Beenai Hamari Aankhon Ki</p><p>Dil Darta Hai Uftaad Na Ho Meray Baba Teri Raahon Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Khaali Hujray Khaali Bistar Jab Daikhti Hoon Baba Ghar Mein</li><p>Eik Hook Si Dil Mein Uthti Hai Eik Dard Sa Hota Hai Sar Mein</p><p>Hojatay Hain Aansoo Bhi Shamil BaBa Sughra(s.a.) Ki Aanhon Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Woh Aangan Soona Soona Hai Jahan Ghutnion Chalta Tha Asghar(a.s.)</li><p>Mehraab Woh Dil Tarpaati Hai Detay Thay Azan Jis Mein Akbar(a.s.)</p><p>Aaja Asghar(a.s.) Aaja Akbar(a.s.) Aawaz Hai Meri Karahon Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Jis Din Say Gaey Ho Tum(a.s.) Baba Main Soochti Rehti Hoon Aksar</li><p>Te Kaisay Kia Hoga Tum Nay Sehraaon Mein Garmi Ka Yeh Safar</p><p>Jab Koi Shajar Rastaky Mein Nahin Lagay Khaimay Kaisay Chaaon Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Kia Rooth Gaey Baba Mujh Say Kion Suntay Nahin Fariyad Meri</li><p>Kia Aati Nahin Tum Ko Baba Thorhi Si Bhi Ab Yaad Meri</p><p>Hasrat Hai Kitni Aey Baba Aakar Dekho In Aankhon Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Eik Waaday Par Main(s.a.) Zinda Hon Waada Jo Kia Tha Asghar(a.s.)</li><p>Lenay Mujhay Aaengay Bhaiyya(a.s.) Khud Mujh Say Kaha Tha Akbar(a.s.) Nay</p><p>Hai Mujh(s.a.) Ko Yaqeen Meray Baba Sachchai Hai Un Kay Waadon Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Shabaan Gai Ramzan Gaya Aur Eid Bhi Guzri Rotay Huey</li><p>Main(s.a.) Bewaris Si Lagti Hoon Pooray Kunbay Kay Hotay Huey</p><p>Bin Aap Kay Yoon Lagta Hai Mujhay Hain Zehr Ghula Meri Saansoon Mein</p><p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p><li>Woh Din Bhi Kabhi Ab Aaeyga Jab Aun(a.s.)-o-Mohammad(a.s.) Aaengay</li></ol>

<p>Dastak Dekar Darwazay Par Seenay Say Meray Lag Jaaengay</p>
<p>Main(s.a.) Apni Phophi(s.a.) Kay Bachchon(a.s.) Ko Lelongi Apni Baanhoon Mein</p>
<p>(Baba Aao Na) x2</p></font></p>
